<title>USA: Spinnaker to post Q4 charge.</title>
<headline>Spinnaker to post Q4 charge.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spinnaker Industries Inc said on Friday that it expects to report a charge of $1.6 million, or $0.20 to $0.25 a share, for the extinguishment of the company's previously existing credit facility.</p>
<p>In last year's fourth quarter, the company reported a profit of $0.03 a share on revenues of $57.6 million.</p>
</text>
